{
  "version": "1.0",
  "name": "HelixCode Full QA - API",
  "description": "Self-driving (\u00a711.4.98) HelixQA bank exercising the REAL HelixCode HTTP API at the configured base URL. Every step is a real http: request with real status/JSON/body assertions; no manual-review prose, no human action after startup, self-cleaning (read-only / negative paths only). Two genuinely-undrivable classes (JWT-mint, WebSocket) are honest _skip with reasons, never fabricated PASS.",
